# The slowest scroll nav.script found: the SNES list (detailed), Right twice (a quick switch to the next systems:
# Game Boy on the MiSTer, a grid of placeholder covers), then a long fast scroll there, for a profile of that alone
# (f3.sh list c3 1 ... script=rolagb profile=20: sampled from 20 s after ES starts, within the scroll)
settle 30000
key Return
wait 4000
key Down
wait 600
key Right
wait 600
key Right
wait 3000
log rola
hold Down 40000
log fim
quit
